This software is provided for educational and demonstration purposes only.
It should NOT be used as a sole security measure in production environments.

The creators and contributors of this software:
- Make no guarantees about the accuracy of phishing detection
- Are not responsible for any damages resulting from use of this software
- Recommend using professional security tools for real-world protection
- Advise regular updates and retraining of the machine learning model

Phishing techniques evolve constantly. This tool should be used as:
- A learning resource for cybersecurity education
- A demonstration of ML-based threat detection
- A starting point for research and development
- Part of a multi-layered security approach

Always exercise caution when dealing with suspicious URLs and never visit
potentially malicious websites directly.
